			"notes": "## Changes from 1.0.1 to 1.1.0\n\n- **Expanded elevators:** 16 wool colors, copper, and 12 chiseled-block variants, each with its own texture and recipe.\n- **Improved teleporting:** elevators connect vertically across different variants, emit activation particles within 15 blocks, and play both Enderman and Shulker teleport sounds after a successful teleport.\n- **Resource pack independence:** elevator models and textures use dedicated mod assets.\n- **“Elevators” Creative Mode tab** with the Copper Elevator as its icon.\n- **Cauldron conversions:** dirt, coarse dirt, and rooted dirt convert to mud; concrete powder converts to matching concrete.\n- **Beacon bonus:** drop a golden apple onto a fully powered level 4 beacon with Regeneration to grant Saturation V to players within 50 blocks.\n- **New admin commands:** toggle Keep Inventory for an individual player and open a menu to create, edit, or delete trades for the nearest villager.\n- **Compatibility and documentation:** separate 1.1.0 JARs for Minecraft 26.3 and 26.4 Snapshot 7, plus a project wiki with installation and feature guides."
		},
